# Homepage Section Patterns

Reference implementation: `src/app/page.jsx`

## Problems I Solve → `cs-result-card`

```jsx
<Link href={href} className={`cs-result-card cs-result-card--${accent}`}>
  <div className="cs-result-card__top">
    <span className="chip-primary">{category}</span>
    <span className="cs-result-card__num">01</span>
  </div>
  <div className="cs-result-card__metric cs-result-card__metric--title">{title}</div>
  <div className="cs-result-card__transform">...</div>
  <p className="cs-result-card__desc">...</p>
  <span className="cs-result-card__cta">Automate it →</span>
</Link>
```

Section shell: `page-section page-section--white page-section--border`

## Services → `cs-item` grid

Use `cs-grid` (not `service-tile` or `grid-3--services`):

```jsx
<Link href={link} className={`cs-item cs-item--${accent}`}>
  <span className="cs-item__num">01</span>
  <div className="cs-item__body">
    <span className="cs-item__industry">Excel</span>
    <h3 className="cs-item__title">...</h3>
    <p className="cs-item__outcome">...</p>
  </div>
  <svg className="cs-item__arrow">...</svg>
</Link>
```

## Specialization block → static featured card

```jsx
<div className="cs-result-card cs-result-card--primary cs-result-card--featured cs-result-card--static">
```

No `about-panel`, `page-hero__glow`, or radial background wrappers.

## FAQ → `FAQAccordion`

```jsx
<FAQAccordion items={HOME_FAQS} className="faq-list--numbered" />
```

Numbered pills are rendered inside the component (`faq-item--primary|secondary`).

## Bottom CTA

```jsx
<PageCTASection
  heading="..."
  subtext="..."
  solidPrimary
/>
```
